 "name": "Maximum: Antithesis",
 "type": "feat",
 "img": "modules/jjk5e/icons/techniques/inverse.svg",
 "system": {
  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Prerequisite: Must have Synesthesia</em></p>\n<p>You’ve learned to channel your inverted energy outward, inverting the flow of harm itself while your <em>Inverse</em> is active:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>When you take damage within your threshold, you can spend 4 CE as a reaction to reflect half of that damage back to the attacker (damage becomes force or necrotic, your choice) if they are within 30 ft.  </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>When you take damage below your threshold, you can instead spend 1 CE as a free action to transfer the pain. Choose a creature within 30 ft to take force or necrotic damage (your choice) equal to twice your CE modifier.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
